  "hints": ["Keep the k largest readings so far in a NEW MIN HEAP: its TOP is the smallest of them, which is the k-th largest.", "INSERT each reading; IF the heap's SIZE is now GREATER THAN k, TAKE TOP to drop the smallest.", "At the end, RETURN TOP. A MAX heap of every reading would give the right answer but needs a cell per reading."],
